{"seq":3,"slug":"hot-path-optimization-free-threading-upgrade","title":"热路径优化与版本升级：C 扩展加速、free-threading 迁移风险与回归度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/optimization-diagnostics/hot-path-optimization-free-threading-upgrade","wordCount":2364,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"热路径优化与版本升级-c-扩展加速-free-threading-迁移风险与回归度量\">热路径优化与版本升级：C 扩展加速、free-threading 迁移风险与回归度量</h1><p>一个跨境订单导出服务在 CPython 3.14.7 上把「逐行拼接 CSV」改成 <code>&quot;&quot;.join(...)</code>，导出耗时从 2.6ms 掉到 0.35ms——7.4 倍，没有并行、没有改算法。同一次压测里另一个热点是「逐字节算校验和」：Python 循环跑 200KB 用 9.3ms，<code>hashlib.md5</code> 把 1MB 算完只要 1.17ms。本文把热路径优化的三个层级、C 扩展接入方式、3.14 起「官方支持但可选」的 free-threading 迁移风险与回归度量串成一条可执行路径。热路径的字节码基础见同章 <a href=\"../interpreter-bytecode-execution/bytecode-compilation-specialization\">字节码编译与特化自适应解释器</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-热路径的三层归属与成本模型\">核心概念：热路径的三层归属与成本模型</h2><p>一次热路径的时间成本可拆成<strong>派发段</strong>与<strong>元素段</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>hot</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>dispatch</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>dispatch</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>elem</mtext></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>elem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{hot}} = n_{\\text{dispatch}} \\cdot c_{\\text{dispatch}} + n_{\\text{elem}} \\cdot c_{\\text{elem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>for x in xs: s += x*x</code> 里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>dispatch</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>elem</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{dispatch}} \\approx n_{\\text{elem}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7692em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每加一个元素付一次派发成本；<code>sum(map(...))</code> 把派发压成一次 C 调用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>dispatch</mtext></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{dispatch}} \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。把工作往 C 层推的全部道理就在这里——不是让元素成本变小，是消掉派发成本。按「成本归属于谁」划分，热路径只有三层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>归因层</th>\n<th>典型症状</th>\n<th>主要解法</th>\n<th>代价与风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字节码层</td>\n<td>纯 Python 循环占大头</td>\n<td>换内置/标准库聚合、局部变量绑定、<code>__slots__</code></td>\n<td>几乎无风险，收益取决于是否有等价 C 实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容器与内置层</td>\n<td><code>+=</code> 拼串、循环内 <code>append</code>、重复 <code>dict</code> 查找</td>\n<td>用 <code>join</code>、推导式、<code>collections</code> 结构</td>\n<td>无风险，改写局部热路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C 扩展层</td>\n<td>算法本身是 Python 紧循环，无现成 C 等价物</td>\n<td>Cython / 手写 C / Rust(PyO3)</td>\n<td>构建链、GIL 语义、free-threading 兼容三重成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[定位热点&lt;br/&gt;profiler 采样] --&gt; B{成本归因在哪一层}&#10;  B --&gt;|字节码派发为主| C[换内置/标准库聚合]&#10;  B --&gt;|容器操作反模式| D[join/推导式/局部绑定]&#10;  B --&gt;|算法本身是紧循环| E[下沉到 C 扩展&lt;br/&gt;Cython/C/Rust-PyO3]&#10;  C --&gt; F[重跑基准, 确认无回归]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; G[处理 GIL 语义&lt;br/&gt;放锁点/临界区]&#10;  G --&gt; H{是否上 free-threading 构建}&#10;  H --&gt;|否| F&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[查生态就绪度 + TSAN 检 race]&#10;  I --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[定位热点&lt;br/&gt;profiler 采样] --&gt; B{成本归因在哪一层}\n  B --&gt;|字节码派发为主| C[换内置/标准库聚合]\n  B --&gt;|容器操作反模式| D[join/推导式/局部绑定]\n  B --&gt;|算法本身是紧循环| E[下沉到 C 扩展&lt;br/&gt;Cython/C/Rust-PyO3]\n  C --&gt; F[重跑基准, 确认无回归]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; G[处理 GIL 语义&lt;br/&gt;放锁点/临界区]\n  G --&gt; H{是否上 free-threading 构建}\n  H --&gt;|否| F\n  H --&gt;|是| I[查生态就绪度 + TSAN 检 race]\n  I --&gt; F</pre><p>关键判断只有一句：<strong>成本落在第三层时，前两层的技巧都是噪声。</strong> 本机实测（CPython 3.14.7，Clang 22.1.3，14 逻辑核，GIL 构建，<code>sysconfig.get_config_var(&#39;Py_GIL_DISABLED&#39;)</code> 返回 <code>0</code>）给出层与层的量级差：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试</th>\n<th>纯 Python 写法</th>\n<th>C 层等价写法</th>\n<th>实测比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>求 200 万元素和</td>\n<td><code>for ...: s += x</code> 0.0243s</td>\n<td><code>sum(xs)</code> 0.0052s</td>\n<td>4.9×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拼接 10 万段字符串</td>\n<td><code>s += x</code> 循环 0.0026s</td>\n<td><code>&quot;&quot;.join(parts)</code> 0.0003s</td>\n<td>7.4×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验和（逐字节 200KB 9.3ms / <code>hashlib.md5</code> 1MB 1.17ms）</td>\n<td>逐字节循环</td>\n<td>OpenSSL C 实现</td>\n<td>每字节约 40×</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>同组里还有反直觉数据：<code>for x in xs: s += x*x</code>（0.0407s）、<code>sum(x*x for x in xs)</code>（0.0396s）、<code>sum(map(lambda x: x*x, xs))</code>（0.0456s）几乎相等——3.14 的 PEP 659 特化解释器把整数乘法的 <code>BINARY_OP</code> 特化成无类型检查的专用指令，派发成本已接近 C 调用。<strong>「推导式一定比循环快」这类法则在 3.14 之后不再普适，优化前必须先测量。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"c-扩展加速-把派发成本压成一次调用\">C 扩展加速：把派发成本压成一次调用</h2><p>下沉到 C 层有两条路。第一条是<strong>不写 C</strong>：找标准库或成熟扩展里已有的等价实现——<code>sum</code>、<code>join</code>、<code>hashlib</code>、<code>array</code>、<code>struct</code>、<code>re</code>、<code>collections.Counter</code>，代价是零构建复杂度，上表 4.9× 与 7.4× 的收益全部来自这条路径。第二条才是写扩展：Cython、手写 CPython C-API、Rust 的 PyO3 共享同一条原理——把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>dispatch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{dispatch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从「每元素一次」降到「每次调用一次」。以 Cython 为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# faststats.pyx — 构建: cythonize -i faststats.pyx&#10;def rolling_checksum(bytes data):&#10;    cdef unsigned int h = 0&#10;    cdef unsigned char b&#10;    for b in data:&#10;        h = (h * 31 + b) &amp; 0xFFFFFFFF&#10;    return h\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># faststats.pyx — 构建: cythonize -i faststats.pyx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rolling_checksum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes data):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cdef unsigned </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cdef unsigned char b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 31</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> 0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FFFFFFFF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h</span></span></code></pre></div><p>若这段 C 计算足够重且不触碰 Python 对象，可用 <code>Py_BEGIN_ALLOW_THREADS</code> / <code>Py_END_ALLOW_THREADS</code> 放掉 GIL 让其他线程真并行——放锁形态见同 hub <a href=\"../gil-concurrency-runtime/cpu-bound-io-release-patterns\">GIL 放锁形态与并发异常</a>。<strong>放锁区间内绝不能触碰引用计数（<code>Py_INCREF</code>/<code>Py_DECREF</code>）、不能回调 Python</strong>，否则引用计数会在无 GIL 保护下被撕裂——这正是后文 free-threading 要系统化处理的同一类问题。隐藏成本在<strong>发布侧</strong>：为每个 Python 版本 × 平台 × 是否 free-threaded 各出一份 wheel，自由线程产物带 <code>t</code> 后缀（解释器 <code>python3.14t</code>、wheel tag <code>cp314-cp314t</code>），两种构建的 wheel <strong>不能互换</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-14-的自由线程构建-迁移风险清单\">3.14 的自由线程构建：迁移风险清单</h2><p>分水岭是 <strong>PEP 779</strong>：free-threading 在 3.13 是实验性的（PEP 703 的可选构建 <code>--disable-gil</code>），到 3.14 转为「<strong>官方支持但可选</strong>」（<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.14/whatsnew/3.14.html\">docs.python.org/3.14 Whatsnew</a>）。官方给出的单线程代价是<strong>约 5–10%</strong>，内存因 immortal 常量、mimalloc 取代 pymalloc、QSBR 延迟回收、偏向式引用计数而<strong>普遍更高</strong>（<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.14/howto/free-threading-python.html\">Python support for free threading</a>）。性能代价不是难点，<strong>兼容性是</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险面</th>\n<th>具体表现</th>\n<th>检测 / 处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>未适配的 C 扩展</td>\n<td>导入时<strong>自动重新启用 GIL</strong> 并打印警告</td>\n<td><code>sys._is_gil_enabled()</code> 返回 <code>True</code> 即已被拖回 GIL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引用计数撕裂</td>\n<td>扩展内共享可变全局出现真数据竞争</td>\n<td>迁移到 <code>Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION</code> 或进程内锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>借用引用失效</td>\n<td><code>PyList_GET_ITEM</code> 等无锁宏在并发修改下悬空</td>\n<td>改用强引用版 <code>PyList_GetItemRef</code> / <code>PyDict_GetItemRef</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PyDict_Next</code> 无锁</td>\n<td>遍历中被并发修改</td>\n<td>用临界区包住整个迭代</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配域混用</td>\n<td>自由线程构建下对象<strong>必须</strong>从 object 域分配</td>\n<td>审计 <code>PyObject_Malloc</code>，普通缓冲改用 <code>PyMem_Malloc</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨线程共享可变态</td>\n<td>读其他线程活动 frame 的 <code>f_locals</code> 可崩溃、共享迭代器漏元素</td>\n<td>禁止跨线程读活动 frame；每线程独立迭代器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>运行期控制两个入口：<code>PYTHON_GIL</code> 环境变量与 <code>-X gil</code> 命令行；进程内查询用 <code>sys._is_gil_enabled()</code>，构建期识别用 <code>sysconfig.get_config_var(&quot;Py_GIL_DISABLED&quot;)</code>。扩展声明「支持无 GIL」的方式是 multi-phase init 加 <code>Py_mod_gil</code> 槽位、single-phase init 调 <code>PyUnstable_Module_SetGIL(m, Py_MOD_GIL_NOT_USED)</code>——<strong>这一步不做，迁移努力会被那个警告一笔勾销</strong>，因为 GIL 会被重新打开（<a href=\"https://docs.python.org/3.14/howto/free-threading-extensions.html\">Free-threaded C extensions howto</a>）。临界区不是普通互斥锁：线程若在临界区内阻塞（等锁、做 I/O），<strong>所有已持有的临界区锁会被挂起释放</strong>，解除阻塞后只重新获取<strong>最顶层</strong>的一个；因此嵌套临界区<strong>不会同时持有多个对象</strong>，需同时锁两个对象必须用 <code>Py_BEGIN_CRITICAL_SECTION2</code>。这些宏在 GIL 构建下是空操作，可安全写在共享代码里。另一个默认值差异：自由线程构建默认开启 <code>sys.flags.thread_inherit_context</code> 与 <code>-X context_aware_warnings</code>，新建线程会复制调用者的 <code>contextvars.Context</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回归度量-怎么证明升级没有变慢\">回归度量：怎么证明升级没有变慢</h2><p>宏观用 <code>pyperformance</code> 跑几何平均（官方 5–10% 单线程代价即以它为基准），回答「整体有没有退化」，但对「哪个函数变慢」无能为力。微观用采样 profiler——社区推荐 <code>samply</code>，它把原生帧与 Python 帧放进同一个 Firefox Profiler 视图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"samply record python -X perf test.py     # Linux: -X perf 才带 Python 帧标注&#10;samply record --pid $PROCESS_PID         # 无侵入 attach 到运行中进程\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">samply</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> python</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test.py</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # Linux: -X perf 才带 Python 帧标注</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">samply</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --pid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $PROCESS_PID         </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 无侵入 attach 到运行中进程</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>-X perf</code> 下 Python 帧浅蓝、原生帧黄色，是判断「时间花在解释器还是 C 扩展」最直接的手段（<a href=\"https://py-free-threading.github.io/profiling/\">Multithreaded Profiling with samply</a>）。正确性检测用 <strong>Thread Sanitizer（TSAN）</strong>：数据竞争在 GIL 构建下不存在，只有自由线程构建才会暴露。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"CC=/path/to/clang CXX=/path/to/clang++ \\&#10;  ./configure --disable-gil --with-thread-sanitizer --prefix &quot;$PWD/cpython-tsan&quot;&#10;make -j8 &amp;&amp; make install&#10;TSAN_OPTIONS=&#39;allocator_may_return_null=1 halt_on_error=1&#39; pytest -s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/path/to/clang</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CXX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/path/to/clang++</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  ./configure</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --disable-gil</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --with-thread-sanitizer</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prefix</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$PWD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/cpython-tsan\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -j8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TSAN_OPTIONS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'allocator_may_return_null=1 halt_on_error=1'</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pytest</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TSAN 会放慢执行并可能因 ASLR 报错（Linux 需 <code>vm.mmap_rnd_bits=28</code>），建议只跑用 <code>threading</code> / <code>ThreadPoolExecutor</code> 的测试子集，并用 suppressions 文件屏蔽已知问题（<a href=\"https://py-free-threading.github.io/thread_sanitizer/\">Using Thread Sanitizer</a>）。三门串联成放行链：<strong>pyperformance 几何均值不超 10% 退化 → samply 火焰图确认热点归属层没有意外迁移 → TSAN 零 race 报告 → 生态 wheel 齐全性检查 → 灰度影子流量对比 P50/P99</strong>；任一环不过就回退重新定位。门限要单独盯 <strong>P99 而非均值</strong>：内存占用因 mimalloc 与 QSBR 上升 15–20%，在内存吃紧的容器里先表现为 GC 抖动与尾延迟尖峰，均值看不出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生态就绪度盘点-哪些包还会卡住你\">生态就绪度盘点：哪些包还会卡住你</h2><p>自由线程能否落地，最终由<strong>你依赖的 C 扩展是否出 <code>cp314t</code> wheel</strong>决定。社区追踪页（2026-09-25 更新）统计 <strong>152 个项目</strong>，其中 <strong>131 个已列出首个支持版本</strong>、21 个尚无版本（含 <code>grpcio</code>、<code>polars</code>、<code>protobuf</code>、<code>psycopg</code>、<code>orjson</code>、<code>zstandard</code> 等仍待跟进者），16 个提供 nightly wheel（<a href=\"https://py-free-threading.github.io/tracking/\">Free-threading tracking</a>）。主流栈已基本就位：NumPy 2.1.0、pandas 2.2.3、PyArrow 18.0.0、PyTorch 2.6.0、SciPy 1.15.0、scikit-learn 1.6.0、cryptography 46.0.0、Cython 3.1.0、CFFI 2.0.0。PyPI 上是否真有 wheel 交给自动追踪器 <a href=\"https://hugovk.github.io/free-threaded-wheels/\">free-threaded-wheels</a>（追踪页提醒「无发布标记的版本号可能只是计划版本」）。生态还提供<strong>分级声明</strong>：trove classifier <code>Free Threading :: 1 - Unstable</code> 到 <code>4 - Resilient</code>，从「仅供试验」到「完全支持且线程安全」，是判断依赖能否上生产最快的信号。发布侧的变化是 <strong>abi3t</strong>：CPython 3.15 起支持自由线程稳定 ABI，一个 <code>cp315-abi3.abi3t</code> wheel 同时覆盖 GIL 与自由线程两种构建（3.14 及更早仍需 <code>cp314-cp314t</code> 单独构建），但 abi3t <strong>只保证 ABI 兼容、不保证线程安全</strong>，扩展仍须先移植并测试（<a href=\"https://py-free-threading.github.io/abi3t/\">abi3t</a>）。</p>\n<p>迁移选型清单按依赖顺序：<strong>先查生态</strong>（C 扩展依赖是否都有 <code>cp314t</code> wheel，缺一个就退回 GIL）；<strong>再查自研扩展</strong>（是否声明 <code>Py_mod_gil</code>、是否有跨线程共享的可变全局）；<strong>后跑 TSAN</strong>；<strong>最后压内存</strong>（15–20% 增量要在容器限额下验证 P99）。若最终不上自由线程，绕开 GIL 的替代路径见同 hub <a href=\"../gil-concurrency-runtime/threading-subinterpreter-multiprocessing-model\">多线程、子解释器与多进程模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>热路径成本拆成<strong>派发段 + 元素段</strong>；优化的本质是消灭派发次数。归因落在哪一层决定解法——字节码层换内置函数、容器层改反模式、紧循环才下沉 C 扩展。</li>\n<li>本机 3.14.7 实测确立量级：<code>sum</code> 比手写循环快 4.9×、<code>join</code> 比 <code>+=</code> 快 7.4×、<code>hashlib</code> 每字节约 40×；但推导式/<code>map</code>/循环在特化解释器下已近乎持平，<strong>先测量再改</strong>。</li>\n<li>C 扩展把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>dispatch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{dispatch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispatch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压成 1，代价是构建链与发布矩阵；放锁区间内禁止触碰引用计数与回调 Python。</li>\n<li>free-threading 在 3.14 起按 <strong>PEP 779</strong> 官方支持但可选，单线程代价约 5–10%、内存高 15–20%；真正的门是<strong>生态 wheel 覆盖 + 扩展声明 <code>Py_mod_gil</code></strong>。</li>\n<li>迁移风险集中：借用引用失效、<code>PyDict_Next</code> 无锁、分配域混用、跨线程活动 frame/迭代器访问；临界区是<strong>栈式可挂起</strong>语义，不是普通互斥锁。</li>\n<li>回归度量三件套：<code>pyperformance</code> 几何均值门（盯 P99 与内存）、<code>samply -X perf</code> 火焰图定层、TSAN 检 race。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"热路径优化与版本升级：C 扩展加速、free-threading 迁移风险与回归度量","id":"热路径优化与版本升级-c-扩展加速-free-threading-迁移风险与回归度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：热路径的三层归属与成本模型","id":"核心概念-热路径的三层归属与成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"C 扩展加速：把派发成本压成一次调用","id":"c-扩展加速-把派发成本压成一次调用"},{"level":2,"text":"3.14 的自由线程构建：迁移风险清单","id":"3-14-的自由线程构建-迁移风险清单"},{"level":2,"text":"回归度量：怎么证明升级没有变慢","id":"回归度量-怎么证明升级没有变慢"},{"level":2,"text":"生态就绪度盘点：哪些包还会卡住你","id":"生态就绪度盘点-哪些包还会卡住你"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内存增长诊断：tracemalloc 快照差分、对象统计、RSS 与堆对象偏差定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/cpython-interpreter-gil-memory-internals/optimization-diagnostics/memory-leak-diagnostics-tracemalloc"},"next":null}